prompt-stack/v33/codex/CODEX_RUNTIME_GUIDE.md-352-- Appendix B / GUI, browser, device, or computer-use interaction -> `PROMPT_tool_protocol_overlay` plus base environment classes; add `PROMPT_search_reasoning_overlay` when visual/action-observation loops, intermediate state checks, or perception-driven replans materially matter
